			"mark": "TALK_MARK_COMMON",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Zhiqiong",
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710360201,
					"content": "#Hello, {NICKNAME}! How have things been?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360202,
						710360204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360202,
					"content": "Pretty good. Are you feeling better?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710360203,
					"content": "Thanks for your concern. I'm quite fine now, thanks. I'm sorry for causing you trouble before.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360206,
					"content": "C'mon, Zhiqiong, just stop running around everywhere already, or you'll end up like you did the last time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360207,
					"content": "Alright, I won't. Thanks to your efforts, The Chasm has become a lot safer. The geological peculiarities here have also, well, stabilized a fair bit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360208,
					"content": "However, Jinwu and Khedive still need to conduct further analysis on that mysterious crystal's... Uh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360209,
					"content": "Wavelength, I think Khedive called it? I guess it's just some sort of weird Sumeru jargon. Whatever the case, we need to plant some beacons and get some of that data.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360210,
					"content": "Jinwu finally found the time to put those beacons together, and I need to put them down in a few specific locations to get the data we need.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360211,
					"content": "After a while, we can go and collect them, and Khedive will then sift through the data obtained.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360212,
					"content": "Previously, there were too many hazardous areas for us to do anything but perform data analysis from our campsite...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360213,
					"content": "But now that you've cleared much of the way for us, we can use the beacons to get more accurate data.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360214,
					"content": "*sigh* Well, having something to do is better than having nothing at all on your plate. Ah, right! Do you mind coming with me if you're free?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360215,
						710360217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360215,
					"content": "Lead the way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360216
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710360216,
					"content": "Alright then, let's go!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360217,
					"content": "Sooo, what's in it for me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710360218,
					"content": "Come on, that's way too direct! ...Although Paimon would like to know, too...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360219,
					"content": "Haha, this should be a milk run, but I doubt Jinwu won't have anything for you in return.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360204,
					"content": "Well, still alive in spite of everything. How are you doing?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710360205,
					"content": "I'm alright... But I wouldn't say I'm super good. I mean, you did hog all the exploration glory, didn't you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7103603,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7103610
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7103610",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7103610,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Zhiqiong"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710360301,
					"content": "Well, thanks for your help! Please, take this as a little token of appreciation.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360302,
					"content": "You're too kind.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710360303,
					"content": "Well, the various geological anomalies have mostly stopped lately, which means that I've just needed to make some small amendments to my maps.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360304,
					"content": "Thanks to your adventures, our work has become a lot easier, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360305,
					"content": "Ah, don't let me keep you any longer. Whether you need some rest or would like to continue your adventures, please, go ahead!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710360306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710360306,
					"content": "It's going to be a while before we will go and retrieve the beacons. It'll be nice if you could help us out then, too!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7104116,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7103713",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7103713,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Zhiqiong",
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710411201,
					"content": "Do you need something?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411202,
						710411212,
						710411223,
						710411232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411202,
					"content": "About your maps...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710411203,
					"content": "Eh? My maps? There's honestly not much to be said about them. Before I joined the Adventurers' Guild, I was the mine cartographer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411204,
					"content": "Of course, I wasn't just some person sitting behind a desk... In fact, we couldn't be more different.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411234,
					"content": "I was once commissioned by them to map out the terrain of Qiaoying Village... and after all that work, they canceled the construction project just like that, with only a word.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411205,
					"content": "People like them get assistants to do the dirty exploration work and information-gathering for them, and then they start drawing... But those like me? We can't do that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411206,
					"content": "As... well, half a miner myself, I've long gotten used to passing through the dangerous underground passages. It's just the way the job works.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411207,
					"content": "Also, after that great change, the lower levels of The Chasm have really been truly unstable.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411208,
					"content": "Eh? Unstable? Is that very dangerous?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411209,
					"content": "You bet it is. The terrain here is slowly but constantly changing. A path today might be a rock wall next month. It's almost as if... How should I say this...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411210,
					"content": "It's almost as if The Chasm itself is changing shape as it likes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411211,
					"content": "Uh... things can't be that spooky, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411212,
					"content": "Tell me about your life as an adventurer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710411213,
					"content": "Haha, what? My \"life\"? You don't have to be so polite. I'm just a newbie. I've barely started my journey, unlike you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411214,
					"content": "I have completed some commissions from the Guild, of course, but I'm not that experienced yet, so I haven't done much solo exploration. I don't think I've left any tales of my deeds behind either...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411215,
					"content": "So I've been thinking that The Chasm might be just the place for me to make my mark for future generations to remember me by.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411216,
					"content": "The Chasm might be, to quote the great adventurer Alice, my \"Rubicon\"!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411217,
						710411220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411217,
					"content": "The Rubicon... is that hilichurl language?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710411218,
					"content": "Paimon's never heard of that one either...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411219,
					"content": "Well, I'm not too sure myself, but given that Alice is an adventurer who has seen the entire world, so that must be some place she's been to... right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411220,
					"content": "Your Rubicon, huh? That's pretty impressive.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710411221,
					"content": "Wait, you don't even know what that is!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411222,
					"content": "Haha, regardless, thanks for your encouragement!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411223,
					"content": "What do you think about Clitopho?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411224
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710411224,
					"content": "Him? I don't trust him. We've had to deal with the Treasure Hoarders above the mines for who-knows how long. They're up to no good. I know it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411225,
					"content": "Don't you trust a word that he says. Turning over a new leaf... Washing his hands of the situation...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411226,
					"content": "While they say such pretty words, they'll be reaching their filthy hands into your back pocket.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411227,
					"content": "Even Rex Lapis would have trouble protecting your wallet from them then!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411228,
					"content": "I'm not prejudiced or anything... I'm just telling you to be wary. The Treasure Hoarders are never to be trusted.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
				},
				{
					"id": 710411229,
					"content": "That does sound like prejudice to me, though.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411230
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710411230,
					"content": "...Maybe it is. You've probably seen a great many more things than I have, so I guess you might be more generous to them. But as for me, I'll always keep an eye at the back of my head, just for them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710411231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhiqiong"
